        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "level1",
      "title": "第一层：简介",
      "start_s": 17.233333333333334,
      "duration_s": 11.8,
      "lead_s": 0.0,
      "tail_s": 0.0,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "level1",
          "spoken_text": "渐进式披露换了个思路：一开始，每个技能只留一行简介，名字加用途。一百个技能，也就占一小条。",
          "subtitle": "一开始 每个技能只留一行简介",
          "start_s": 0.0,
          "absolute_start_s": 17.23333333,
          "duration_s": 11.2,
          "action_s": 5.0,
          "hold_s": 0.6,
          "slot_s": 11.8,
          "audio": "audio/level1-my-voice-lively-80f5a58298a8.wav",
          "audio_sha256": "086d04c7a9f8c1d7e1c096fdc0da5f25f1b7b6f8f39445bd9f42f959ea837aad"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "level2",
      "title": "第二层：正文",
      "start_s": 29.033333333333335,
      "duration_s": 11.733333333333333,
      "lead_s": 0.0,
      "tail_s": 0.0,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "level2",
          "spoken_text": "比如你说：把这份 PDF 转成表格。Agent 对着简介一扫，只有 PDF 这一项对上，这时才把它的完整说明读进来。",
          "subtitle": "只有对上的那一项 才读入完整说明",
          "start_s": 0.0,
          "absolute_start_s": 29.03333333,
          "duration_s": 11.12,
          "action_s": 5.0,
          "hold_s": 0.6,
          "slot_s": 11.733333333333333,
          "audio": "audio/level2-my-voice-lively-6115d48bcd27.wav",
          "audio_sha256": "bb9ec4ce38e78b27db654f51e8ade0af49c7c39cb1376da06e43c86da0bf0f1c"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "files",
      "title": "第三层：文件",
      "start_s": 40.766666666666666,
      "duration_s": 9.233333333333333,
      "lead_s": 0.0,
      "tail_s": 0.0,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "files",
          "spoken_text": "说明里还提到两份参考文件。这次只用得上表单那份，就只读它，另一份留在外面。",
          "subtitle": "只读用得上的那份文件",
          "start_s": 0.0,
          "absolute_start_s": 40.76666667,
          "duration_s": 8.72,
          "action_s": 4.0,
          "hold_s": 0.5,
          "slot_s": 9.233333333333333,
          "audio": "audio/files-my-voice-lively-f0a7d81badfc.wav",
          "audio_sha256": "a58672e737b8cc791dfcde1af3f6712b3fb90513486835285fb1f8cd9befd665"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "script",
      "title": "第三层：脚本",
      "start_s": 50.0,
      "duration_s": 7.4,
      "lead_s": 0.0,
      "tail_s": 0.0,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "script",
          "spoken_text": "脚本更省：代码本身不进窗口，在外面跑完，只把结果送进来。",
          "subtitle": "代码不进窗口 只送回结果",
          "start_s": 0.0,
          "absolute_start_s": 50.0,
          "duration_s": 6.8,
